Yes, Chelsea.
对，切尔西。

188
00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:16.360
Okay.
好。

189
00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:19.880
I mean, I feel like this is so basic, but figure skating.
我是说，我觉得这太基础了，不过是花样滑冰。

190
00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:20.680
Yeah.
对。

191
00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:21.580
Come on.
拜托。

192
00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:23.880
