我有点迷上了冬季两项。

220
00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:11.860
So this is the one where the person sort of like cross-country skis as fast as they can.
所以这就是那种运动员拼尽全力进行越野滑雪的项目。

221
00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.620
And then they have to shoot a rifle at a target.
然后他们必须用步枪射击靶子。

222
00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:18.100
And you have to hit all the targets before you can keep skiing again.
而且你必须射中所有靶子才能继续滑雪。

223
00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:28.800
And it brought back those like sort of survivalist, old-timey, snowy prairie vibes to me, which is just sort of one of my like obsessions.
它让我想起了那种带有生存主义、复古风、白雪皑皑的草原氛围，这正好是我痴迷的东西之一。

224
00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:29.580
This is very you.
这太符合你的风格了。

225
00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:33.800
