由别人来生火。

237
00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:19.360
That's a good idea.
这主意不错。

238
00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.960
Then they have to quickly build a small like shelter.
然后他们必须快速搭建一个小避难所。

239
00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:27.580
Sleep overnight and then back and we watch the entire thing.
睡上一晚，然后返程，我们看着整个过程。

240
00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:28.220
Yeah, I'm in.
行吧，我加入。

241
00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:28.980
Yeah.
好。

242
00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:30.020
So that would be mine.
所以这就是我的选择。

243
00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:32.400
I think I would love to be in the biathlon.
我想我很乐意参加冬季两项。

244
00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:33.580
All right.
好吧。

245
00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:33.880
Okay.
行。

