Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

326
00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.480
They're so scary.
他们太吓人了。

327
00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:08.640
So scary.
太吓人了。

328
00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:12.000
But I'm always like, when they make the little splash, I was like, I want to be able to make
但我总是想，当他们激起小小水花时，我就想，我要是能激起

329
00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:12.780
that little splash.
那种小小水花就好了。

